  "audio": null,
  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-C6-Touch-AMOLED-1.64). The vendor's two code bases disagree on the panel's reset pin: the ESP-IDF BSP says GPIO20, the Arduino example says GPIO21. The glass has rounded corners whose radius Waveshare does not give, so the designer draws them square: keep what matters out of the corners, or set a corner radius on the Display tab once it is measured. On the board and not in this preset: TF card: it is wired onto the panel's own SPI lines, which the export gives to the panel alone. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
